        "category": "offensive",
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>若 30 尺内有 @UUID[Compendium.wang-pf2e-homebrew.homebrew-actors.Actor.whbHuntFlymandr1]{飞翔者}：两人共享猎物印记——对同一目标的打击 +1 环境；任一方布置陷阱时另一方可免费 Step。</p>"
